    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS: Current Patch:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular Patch 030 (8.4.2025)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beta Patch 030 (8.4.2025)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For any questions feel free to ask in Discord!</strong></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <u><strong>Tutorial is HIGHLY RECOMMENDED</strong></u> even if having played the demo (now removed due to age) as there are differences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Merchant's Promise</strong>\u00a0features\u00a0<strong>No Inventory &amp; Physics-based Inspired\u00a0</strong>gameplay.\u00a0You are in <strong>full control</strong> of the item you handle from the time you pick them up until you put them down...or throw them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Merchant Status is everything and will determine how easily you can adjust your prices to make the most profit.\u00a0There is also a <strong>Permanent Death</strong> option for those that like more risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Starting as a lowly\u00a0<strong>Merchant</strong>\u00a0you can eventually earn your way to a\u00a0<strong>King's Merchant </strong>through trading as you experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Loss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light survival elements (hunger, thirst, health, and stamina)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Merchant's Promise will not micro-manage you:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited Menus and UI's as possible...and still trying to be reduced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No &quot;Objectives&quot; or &quot;Tasks&quot; will pop up telling you what to do and how to do it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Talk</strong>, <strong>Read</strong>, and\u00a0<strong>Interact</strong> with things to learn about the world you play in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>...did I mention the <strong>Main Game Tutorial  is strongly encouraged?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game receives regular updates and is worked on Full Time (+)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Priorities of Continued EA Development:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Game World</strong> - I am working hard to bring more elements of &quot;life&quot; and &quot;depth&quot; into the game as current features are also tested by those of you that play the <strong>Beta Version</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consistent &amp; Reliable gameplay</strong> - Physics games are quirky and a lot of adjustments are always being made</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance</strong> - No one wants a 47GB game download that gets 12FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gets the bugs out</strong> - I  handle these through the Discord Reporting (Link on Store Page or In Game) as soon as possible with a ticket system so you can stay up-to-date on your issue's progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for taking the time to visit and I look forward to providing you with a great product and fun challenge!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>EARLY ACCESS: Current Patch:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regular Patch 030 (8.4.2025)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beta Patch 030 (8.4.2025)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>For any questions feel free to ask in Discord!</strong></h2></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <u><strong>Tutorial is HIGHLY RECOMMENDED</strong></u> even if having played the demo (now removed due to age) as there are differences.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Merchant's Promise</strong>\u00a0features\u00a0<strong>No Inventory &amp; Physics-based Inspired\u00a0</strong>gameplay.\u00a0You are in <strong>full control</strong> of the item you handle from the time you pick them up until you put them down...or throw them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your Merchant Status is everything and will determine how easily you can adjust your prices to make the most profit.\u00a0There is also a <strong>Permanent Death</strong> option for those that like more risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Starting as a lowly\u00a0<strong>Merchant</strong>\u00a0you can eventually earn your way to a\u00a0<strong>King's Merchant </strong>through trading as you experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Item Loss</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weather</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light survival elements (hunger, thirst, health, and stamina)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Merchant's Promise will not micro-manage you:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited Menus and UI's as possible...and still trying to be reduced.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No &quot;Objectives&quot; or &quot;Tasks&quot; will pop up telling you what to do and how to do it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>Explore</strong>, <strong>Talk</strong>, <strong>Read</strong>, and\u00a0<strong>Interact</strong> with things to learn about the world you play in.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>...did I mention the <strong>Main Game Tutorial  is strongly encouraged?</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game receives regular updates and is worked on Full Time (+)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Priorities of Continued EA Development:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Game World</strong> - I am working hard to bring more elements of &quot;life&quot; and &quot;depth&quot; into the game as current features are also tested by those of you that play the <strong>Beta Version</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consistent &amp; Reliable gameplay</strong> - Physics games are quirky and a lot of adjustments are always being made</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Performance</strong> - No one wants a 47GB game download that gets 12FPS.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gets the bugs out</strong> - I  handle these through the Discord Reporting (Link on Store Page or In Game) as soon as possible with a ticket system so you can stay up-to-date on your issue's progress.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thank you for taking the time to visit and I look forward to providing you with a great product and fun challenge!</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Physics-Based Medieval Trading &amp; Transport Simulator. Start as a Worthless Merchant and work your way up as you carefully handle and transport your goods through a stylized Medieval World!",
